00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.760
Even the stars of the sky

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.020
lie billions of lightyears away,

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:35.900
shining beyond the shadows.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:42.160
Let me speak of hope,

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:48.240
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:54.290
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:59.760
then rather than consoling you,

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:06.430
let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.270
Make the most of our days off, huh?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.110
Chieri? Where are you going?

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.570
Shopping.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.740
What are you buying?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.580
How I spend my day off is my own business.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.290
Chieri...

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.040
Look at her, going off on her own...

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.840
On her own...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.010
Nagisa?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.840
Why does she care so much?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:51.430
Makoto, come join me for a bit.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.560
Huh? For what?

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.100
Don't worry, you'll love it!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.690
Hey, Linda! Come with Sonata!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:05.570
Don't you want to be with Kanata-san?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:10.080
But there's something Sonata wants to try!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.790
Sonati... so wild.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.590
It's 'cause usually...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.380
<i>Ducky, ducky...</i>

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.140
<i>The bath is not a playground!</i>

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.720
...and Sis-sis yells at me.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.980
I always wanted to have some fun in this bath!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.570
If you were that eager,
I guess now is the best time.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.530
Hey.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.650
Is there anything you want to do, Linda?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.490
There's...

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.620
something about 00's administration that's been bothering me.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.660
The administration?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.500
Yes.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:01.130
When we came to Akibastar, we met all the staff who support us.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.670
But...

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.970
there must be somebody at the top directing 00.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.220
Sensei-sensei.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.310
Mayuyu-san.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.520
When did you—

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:18.390
Excuse me, but who is Sensei-sensei—

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.900
My extra helpings are in here...

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:23.900
Hang on!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.990
Extra helpings... Extra helpings...

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.570
Rice...

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:36.290
I've been thinking that you lack stamina, Makoto.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.620
Give me a break, Kanata-san!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.420
I don't want my muscles to get all huge...

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.590
You know, we're supposed to be idols...

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.500
Yay! Luscious legs!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.500
Huh?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.510
Kojiharu-san?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.430
Luscious! Luscious!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.850
Kanata's luscious legs!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:58.060
L-Luscious legs?!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:04.320
Nyan-Nyan thinks you gals
could use more pheromones.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:06.900
Pheromones?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.360
Looks like you need some Nyan training.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.200
I'll call it "Operation Luscious Pheromones"!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.370
Come on! No time to waste!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.500
H-Hold on!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.620
Kojiharu-san?

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.790
Pheromones! How wonderful!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:24.340
I'd be happy to—

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.040
Mimori.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.380
You already reek of pheromones.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.590
There, there, Sayaka.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.300
Really? You think so?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.640
Who are you, Tomo-mi?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.560
I can't take any more.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.890
Come on, Sae! You grab that side!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.020
Sure, sure.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.100
Idols are less about sex appeal and more about purity!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.610
I'll call it "Operation Lose Those Pheromones"!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.860
L-Lose them?

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.490
Those voices...

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.780
They sound kind of scary...

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.290
You're supposed to have the day off.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.290
You don't have to help me.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.870
We don't mind.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.500
It's the least we could do.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.880
Well, I don't mind the help.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.800
You should take a break yourself.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.630
We've got this.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.380
Really?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.100
Then I think I'll go shopping for a new rice cooker.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.600
See you later!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.810
Nagisa should be helping us out.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:27.060
Why is she worried about dumb old Chieri?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:27.980
Jealous?

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.860
Don't be stupid! That's not it.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.030
Tomochin-san.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.530
Is breakfast... over already?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:43.080
Yes, and Chef Papa is out.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.330
Could you get me something to eat?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.920
Well, I can do fried rice.

