Marie's
Crepes

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.780
Have a nice day!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.880
<i>Chieri...</i>

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.380
The heiress of Zodiac Corporation,
missing or kidnapped...?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:32.880
The heiress of the Zodiac Corporation, missing or kidnapped?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.050
<i>Is she having trouble with her family?</i>

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.470
Are you going to follow me all day?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.230
Um, I...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:45.940
Excuse me!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.770
Chieri! Watch out!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.360
Hurry up and run!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.480
Run already!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.900
Run? Why?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:57.110
Besides, I can't run if you're on top of me.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:02.030
Wh-Wh-What do you need her for?!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:05.500
Um, I don't mean to be rude,

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.000
but the tag is still on your skirt.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:08.750
What?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:09.630
Huh?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.670
I'm so sorry.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.300
Thank you.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.550
You know,

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:25.310
if there's anything on your mind, I'm here to listen.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.770
Why are you bringing this up?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:32.570
I was just hoping you'd open up more to me.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.400
Chieri!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.830
Nice shot!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.790
Yuuko-san?

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.590
This one, too.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:03.350
All of 00's lyrics and publications are credited to the same name.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.270
S-Quadruple?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.440
It means four of them.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.520
Four S's in a row.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.320
Remember what Mayuyu-san said.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.110
"Sensei-sensei"...

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.990
That's four S's.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.400
Yukirin-san?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.740
Sorry, girls.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:27.790
Even us successors are forbidden from investigating S-Quadruple.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.160
Forbidden?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.500
What would happen if you tried?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.500
If you did...

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.550
your belly button would be stolen.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.800
Belly button?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.850
S-Quadruple...

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.180
Belly button...

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.980
It's Tsubasa.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.690
Sensei-sensei did?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.900
I see. Understood.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.520
I'll be right there.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.360
Sensei-sensei...

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.200
Huh?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.870
As a diehard 00 fan, I cannot pass this up.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.620
Follow her, Sonati!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:12.920
No way! Sonata kinda wants to keep her belly button!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.380
I let you drag me to the bath.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.080
But...

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.800
Not my belly button!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.010
Sorry for asking you to help.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.760
Don't worry about it.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.390
Right here.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.480
W-Wow...

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.940
Your courtyard is like a park.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.940
Tomomi? Welcome home.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:40.280
Oh my. Are you the new understudies?

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.490
Yep.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.530
Nice to meet you!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.370
Her mother is beautiful.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.280
Tomochin-san looks just like her.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.540
Oh, understudies?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.790
77th generation, huh?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.670
Goodness me, how precious.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.540
There's a bunch of Tomochin-sans!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.470
Amazing.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.680
Every Tomochin-san in history.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.720
They all look the same.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:13.680
Sense of Beauty

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:13.230
Our family has succeeded Itano Tomomi for generations.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.810
Itano Tomomi for every generation?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:23.860
You don't need to look exactly like the original to become a 00 successor.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:29.580
Nonetheless, the original Tomochin's blood runs strongly in our family,

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.830
and we've all undertaken special training to become Tomochin.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.500
And last but not least...

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.290
Tomomi.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.130
Welcome home.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:38.880
Daddy.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.300
Enjoy your visit, understudies.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.630
Thank you very much!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.680
We marry men who resemble
Tomochin, so our children will, too.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.100
That's unbelievable.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.060
Yeah.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.970
I see you've kept them with you.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.270
Yes.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.310
Scrolls?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.560
So that's what was inside.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.070
The Book of Tomochin:

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.530
48 volumes in total.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.150
Since you helped me, want to take a peek?

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.450
Sure...

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:07.570
Volume
XXVII

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:07.570
Volume

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:07.610
The Law of Tomochin Vol. XVIII

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:11.950
"She who doth be Tomochin shalt have an unfaltering sense of beauty."

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:16.250
"She who doth be Tomochin shalt ne'er have a proper sense of taste."

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.460
I see...

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.920
No!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.380
Turn your legs more inward!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.260
Okay...

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:33.810
'S-Sup! How's it hanging?

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:34.430
Mimori?!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.350
I can't!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.400
My breasts are killing me.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.980
Plus, it's too hot around my neck.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.530
There you go again! Spewing pheromones everywhere!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.530
Too hot!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.320
You still lack discipline!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.240
Huh?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.030
Ten more laps around the dorm!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.280
No! No!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.280
Sorry for bothering you.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.250
I guess pheromones...

00:14:56.250 --> 00:15:00.040
...are harder to get rid of than to obtain.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.380
I think she's a special case.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.670
Takamina-san looks cute in this one.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.180
She's making a funny face, though.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.220
I know, right?

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.640
Same with Yukirin-san.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.390
Yeah, totally.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.600
I just love cameras.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.980
I always photograph the other members during our breaks.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.400
I didn't expect that.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:22.860
Expect what?

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.820
I just thought you'd play sports on your days off.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.410
Believe it or not, photography is my hobby.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.120
Reading and puzzles, too.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.370
About as mundane as it gets.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.580
Kirara?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.910
Is this the last Acchan?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:46.880
The last Acchan was the most amazing person.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.590
She was usually shy and reserved,

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:54.970
but when she stepped on stage, the Kirara all flocked to her in a glowing cloud.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.220
It was like she was wearing a dress of light.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.890
Back then, I was still an understudy,

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:06.190
but I swore that someday, I'd
be a Center Nova just like her.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:11.490
Unfortunately, soon after I was promoted, she left us.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.030
Left?

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.660
All of the past Center Novae have
graduated in mysterious ways.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.160
Huh?

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.330
I've heard that before.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.920
They say Acchan disappeared during a concert...

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:24.250
Disappeared?

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:30.380
I was off-duty on Akibastar during that
performance, so I don't know the details.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:35.340
They say that maybe she ran away or was kidnapped.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.720
No way!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.510
Acchan wasn't the only one.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.230
All of the past Center Novae:

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.690
Mii-chan, Yuihan, Tomo-mi, and the others.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.480
No one knows where they've gone.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.820
Of course, plenty of members keep
their reasons for graduation private,

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.780
and some people claim they've sighted Mii-chan on Atamistar.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.370
Still, to prevent the rumors from growing,

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:06.790
when the last Acchan left, the title of Center Nova went with her.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.540
So that's what happened...

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.510
Still, that's not gonna stop me!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:15.470
Acchan was my inspiration.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:20.350
My dream of becoming Center Nova and
surpassing her is what has kept me going.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:27.230
Perhaps I've been working all my life to become Tomochin.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:30.320
But sometimes, I wonder

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:34.070
what it would be like to live as someone other than her.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.030
Tomochin-san...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:38.950
Like Kojiharu.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:49.330
But in the end, I love Tomochin.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:54.050
You know, it took me quite a while

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.430
to become Kojiharu the 8th.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:57.800
Really?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.090
Yep.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.970
Yuuko was in my generation,
and she was promoted before me.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:05.890
I nearly started panicking.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:13.030
In the end, everyone has their own unique traits.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.490
You just gotta try a bit of everything.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.160
Try?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.570
00 is a funny place.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.950
You work hard to become somebody else.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.200
But you know...

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.540
It's our friends that keep us going.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.550
Right, Mimori-san?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.210
Friends...

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.210
Yep.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.680
Bosom buddies. Friends from the heart.

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:45.140
Because our teammates are by our side, chasing the same dream...

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.770
That's what keeps us going!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.230
That's what keeps me inspired!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:56.690
Okay! I'm gonna snap a few more shots and call it a day.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.150
Take care on your way back!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.950
I want to become Yuuko-san.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.200
Huh?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.410
I want to succeed Yuuko-san!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:11.250
You're saying you want Yuuko-san to graduate?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.420
Two successors can't hold the same name at once.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.710
Th-That's true...

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.920
I don't want Yuuko-san to go away.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.970
You like her too, don't you?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:26.310
Yuuko-san's dancing is really dynamic.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:30.560
I hope I can dance like that someday, that's all.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.770
I see.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.570
Don't tell me S-Quadruple...

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.610
is Ushiyama-sensei?

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:47.990
To be honest, I knew I couldn't trust a man like him.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.460
But as they say, love waits for no woman.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.590
It sure didn't wait for me.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.340
But you're a man.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.090
Gosh! My <i>heart</i> is a woman's.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:03.300
I guess not.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.100
Linda, Linda! Look at this!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.770
I found a kitty-cat!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:11.230
Sonati and Mr. Kitty, keep quiet.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:13.770
Like this, right?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.440
Wrong.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.360
But Yuuko-san moved like that at her last performance.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.610
No, the steps were bigger, like this.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.700
When did they all...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.660
U-Um, we're sorry!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.410
This isn't a performance or anything!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:34.080
We were talking about our mentors' dancing and got kinda into it.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.960
