00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.300
Um, sorry for causing a scene!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.180
This is hard.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.560
My lips feel all crooked.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.100
Really?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.810
It's not hard at all.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.320
No, it's impossible.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.690
Sexy!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.820
Sexy!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:06.450
I'm starting to feel the pheromones coming.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.740
Yeah, me too.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.410
I'm feeling pretty sexy, if I do say so myself.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.790
Really?

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.000
Okay! Then let's get even sexier!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.370
Sure thing!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.250
What's wrong, Mimori?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.710
Done already?

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.760
No! I can keep going!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.550
Don't give up, Mimori-san!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.140
Honestly, girl,

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.810
